  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 1a8d063dc5aef6c4cacee76b2ec8ca11, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 14
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 1
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 300
    m_Alignment: 3
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'In this game, players will have to try their luck by spinning the reels
    of the slot machine and collecting points to pass the levels. Each player is
    given a limited number of spins, and they must use them wisely, because if the
    spins run out, the game will end.

    The goal of each level is to reach a certain
    number of points. If the player manages to do this, he moves on to the next level.
    As you pass the levels, the difficulty of the game increases: every 8 levels,
    the slot machine is updated and becomes more powerful. The number of winning
    lines and cells increases, which opens up new opportunities for getting bonuses
    and multipliers.'
